  ("DKA severity (ICMR STW)", "Mild: pH 7.25–7.3, bicarbonate 15–18, alert. Moderate: pH 7.0–7.25, bicarbonate 10–15, drowsy. Severe: pH <7.0, bicarbonate <10, stupor or coma — ICU."),
  ("HHS (2024 consensus)", "Glucose ≥600 mg/dL, effective osmolality >300 mOsm/kg (or total >320), beta-hydroxybutyrate <3.0 mmol/L, pH ≥7.3 and bicarbonate ≥15 mmol/L."),
